# Design & components

## Design

- Follow the existing tactical PUBG UI (tact-* tokens, fonts, clipped panels). Do not introduce a second visual language.
- Design work must be explicit: match the current system unless the user requests a redesign.
- Avoid one-off decorative effects that hurt performance (heavy blur, full-page noise, continuous animations on scrollable lists).

## Components

- Prefer isolated, reusable components under `frontend/src/components/` (or feature folders) over page-local monoliths.
- Replay map, playback controls, dossier stats, and match rows should stay reusable and props-driven.
- Backend parsing/helpers for telemetry belong in dedicated modules (e.g. `telemetry_replay.py`), not buried only in route handlers.
